    {
      "kind": "FR",
      "text": "After start-up, the system shall check every thermostat and turn on any unit that's needed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "FR",
      "text": "When the room temperature is within range, the system shall turn the heating and cooling off."
    },
    {
      "kind": "FR",
      "text": "The system shall not let more than the set maximum number of units run at once."
    },
    {
      "kind": "FR",
      "text": "When a unit turns off, the system shall pick the latest waiting request and turn that unit on if it's still needed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "FR",
      "text": "An alarm shall keep beeping until the supervisor switches it off."
